          "_label": "Details (Official List Description)"
        }
      ],
      "content": "SP 81 NW 1/33 BIERTON WITH BROUGHTON AYLESBURY ROAD (north side) No. 194 (Formerly listed as The Old House) II House. C17 timber framed refronted in C18 red and some blue brick. Old tiled roof, half hipped on left, large central brick chimney stack, with gable top to rear wing to its left. 2-storeys, central door in modern open gabled porch, flanking modern canted bay windows, 3-light leaded casements above and small 2-light casement in centre. Lower 1 bay addition on left with slate roof. C18 brick rear wing. Interior with chamfered ceiling beams. Listing NGR: SP8438315888"
    }
